port sysutils/zellij
type port
reason "DragonFly: cap-primitives 3.4.4 oflags and aws-lc-sys 0.39.0 entropy source"
target @any

# dragonfly/@2026Q3, @2026Q4, @main:
# - cap-primitives 3.4.4: rustix has no OFlags::DSYNC/RSYNC on DragonFly;
#   approximate DSYNC with SYNC and skip RSYNC as for FreeBSD (devel/uv's
#   patch for 4.0.3).
# - aws-lc-sys 0.39.0: define OPENSSL_DRAGONFLY and use getentropy() like
#   the other BSDs; otherwise urandom.c needs Linux's RNDGETENTCNT
#   (misc/py-hf-xet's patches).
